  "estimates_notes": [
    "generate_random_name (estimate/base.py:29-31): 10 chars from string.ascii_lowercase; sample 'ijcabmitbl'.",
    "BUG: bulk create persists the Estimate row BEFORE points validation (:69 vs :78-80), so a 400 on bad points still creates a point-less estimate (see 'Bad' row in bulk_list).",
    "point create requires truthy key AND value (:157): key=0 is rejected with 400 even though the model default is 0.",
    "point destroy loop (estimate/base.py:198-210): per issue it enqueues issue_activity THEN issues.update(estimate_point_id=new) inside the loop (re-evaluated queryset); without new_estimate_id no update runs. Afterwards higher keys decrement by 1 (:234-240) and the response is the decremented-points array (see FX-APROJ-08 for the issue_activity payloads)."
  ]
